id: CTB-SRC0033-i2
source: SRC-0033
section: §2.2
kind: requirement
scope: ARC
title: Constitutional invariant I2: tenant isolation
applied-in: STG-00.A-1
distinct-from: LXM-REQ-000043
text: Tenant isolation is constitutional invariant I2 and is never traded off: no data, configuration or action crosses a tenant boundary unless a contract allows it. Isolation tests per surface check it, and CI and runtime authorization enforce it.
